<body>
<div class="card">

<div class="meta">
  <div class="badge">CD-039 · ¥39</div>
  <h1>草莓长岛冰茶（无柠檬柠檬茶）</h1>
  <div class="sub">茶饮 · 摆摊 ✅ 夜市 ✅ 流动 ✅ 开店 ✅</div>
  <div class="tags">
    <span>无柠檬</span>
    <span>草莓+乌龙</span>
    <span>创意款</span>
    <span>猎奇向</span>
    <span>女生最爱</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="level-banner">
  <span class="level-item high">推荐指数 7.8</span>
  <span class="level-item med">概念新颖</span>
  <span class="level-item med">草莓贵</span>
  <span class="level-item med">猎奇流量</span>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">发现这款产品</div>
  <div class="story">
    今年春天在上海永康路一个创意饮品店，门口贴着"没有柠檬的柠檬茶"。这行字太抓人了，我直接进去了。老板说这个叫草莓长岛冰茶，用的是鸭屎香乌龙茶底加草莓锤碎，不加柠檬但口感跟柠檬茶很接近——草莓的酸度和茶底搭在一起，居然真的有柠檬茶的影子。<br><br>
    老板说他试了七八种水果，草莓是最接近柠檬的酸度结构的。一杯卖16块，他说成本7块左右，草莓选新鲜的，不能用冷冻的。这个款刚推出的时候很多人就是冲着"没有柠檬的柠檬茶"这个噱头来买的。<br><br>
    一天大概能卖30杯左右。买的人里十个有八个是女生，一个是好奇的年轻人。老板说这个是菜单上的"话题款"，适合当新品彩蛋，不适合当走量主力。
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">项目指数</div>
  <div class="index-grid">
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">轻资产</div><div class="num">4.0</div><div class="desc">投入约1700元</div></div>
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">难度</div><div class="num">3.0</div><div class="desc">草莓易出水</div></div>
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">利润</div><div class="num">4.0</div><div class="desc">56%毛利率</div></div>
    <div class="index-item"><div class="label">复购</div><div class="num">2.5</div><div class="desc">猎奇为主</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">成本利润</div>
  <div class="cost-box">
    <div class="row"><span>卖价</span><span class="v">16元/杯（500ml）</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>成本</span><span class="v">7元/杯</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>单杯利润</span><span class="v" style="color:#C0392B">9元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>日销30杯日利润</span><span class="v">270元</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>日销50杯日利润</span><span class="v">450元</span></div>
    <div class="row tot"><span>设备投入</span><span class="v">约1700元</span></div>
  </div>
  <div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#3a322a;margin-top:6px">回本周期</div>
  <div class="roi">
    <div class="roi-b c"><div>保守</div><div class="d">11天</div><div>日销30杯</div></div>
    <div class="roi-b n"><div>正常</div><div class="d">7天</div><div>日销50杯</div></div>
    <div class="roi-b i"><div>理想</div><div class="d">5天</div><div>日销80杯</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">项目风险</div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>草莓成本高</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="off">☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">反季节草莓贵一倍</span>
  </div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>理解成本高</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="off">☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">"无柠檬柠檬茶"需要解释</span>
  </div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>草莓出水</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="off">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">冷冻草莓不能用</span>
  </div>
  <div class="risk-item">
    <span>偏离主业</span>
    <span class="risk-stars"><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="on">★</span><span class="off">☆</span><span class="off">☆</span></span>
    <span style="font-size:10px;color:#b5aaa0;margin-left:auto">走量还是靠经典款</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">启动清单</div>
  <div class="launch">
    <span>雪克杯 30元</span>
    <span>手打锤 15元</span>
    <span>保温桶 200元</span>
    <span>冰桶 80元</span>
    <span>封口机 350元</span>
